<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear client,<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Congratulations again on your new hire. Your new employee can complete their online enrollment in the Insperity Premier Portal; you can share the information below with them to assist them in the process.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Thank you</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</span><br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="" color="#3366ff"><b style="">Access your Insperity Online Employee Enrollment</b>&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Once you have created your Username and Password for Insperity Premier, follow the instructions below to access your Online Employee Enrollment.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ol><li><font face="arial">Login to Insperity Premier.<br></font><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><br><br></li><li><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Once you are logged in you will need to select the <b>Start Now</b> button to access your Online Employee Enrollment.&nbsp;<br></font><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></li><li><font face="arial">Now you can begin your enrollment by selecting <b>Start Now</b> again.&nbsp;<br></font><br><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></li></ol></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">If you are unable to access your Online Employee Enrollment information, please reach out to the<b> Insperity Contact Center at 1-866-715-3552</b> for additional assistance.<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for trusting Insperity to serve your business.</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>